msgstr "Lint 通过（`npm run lint`）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:176 b263e65b5c3044f489d03393c215de29
msgid "Build succeeds (`NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 npm run build`)"
msgstr "构建成功（`NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 npm run build`）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:177 ecf752d41333477c94a0da20ee514e27
msgid "Documentation updated (if applicable)"
msgstr "文档已更新（如适用）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:179 296ca2abe419482dbb6717730db1876d
msgid "Code of Conduct"
msgstr "行为准则"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:181 4fa1d3e80b7146f3a7f965a99b8eb441
msgid ""
"Please be respectful and constructive in all interactions. We aim to "
"create a welcoming and inclusive community."
msgstr "请在所有互动中保持尊重和建设性。我们致力于创建一个友好和包容的社区。"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:183 f66f6ebab4ed4bdea80b1e5625017080
